{"path":"eval/cases/cigster-84/sources/pr.json","ref":"a610a8c226a46a202300b570b1519382fa6a92cd","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":1,"text":"{"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":2,"text":"  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/84\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":3,"text":"  \"number\": 84,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":4,"text":"  \"title\": \"test(e2e): Clerk user fixtures with automatic cleanup\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":5,"text":"  \"body\": \"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\\nCloses #82\\n\\n## Summary\\n- Adds Playwright fixtures for Clerk test users with automatic cleanup:\\n  - `clerkUser` — single-user, test-scoped (chrome)\\n  - `extendClerkUsers([...])` — worker-scoped map for serial multi-user suites\\n- Admin uses `extendClerkUsers([\\\"admin\\\", \\\"empty-sets\\\"])` and passes them into `seedAdmin({ users })`\\n- Host uses `extendClerkUsers([\\\"host\\\"])`; foreign `host.notFound` owner is synthetic (`HOST_FOREIGN_SUBJECT`) — no second Clerk user\\n- Solo / import / player no longer create Clerk users by default (synthetic CLI `--identity` with display name `Visual Seed`). Player keeps opt-in `clerkHost: true`\\n- Removed `shouldResetVisualSeeds` — Convex seed teardown always runs\\n- Rebased onto `main`\\n- Rebaselined ingest/solo Docker goldens to include `by Visual Seed` creator line\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Fixture smoke: tagged Clerk users cleaned after run\\n- Docker golden update for ingest + solo after restoring synthetic display name\\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-9fd66ad6-4d1b-4c25-bb0b-a9b91c4089ac\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Web\\\" width=\\\"114\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-9fd66ad6-4d1b-4c25-bb0b-a9b91c4089ac\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"131\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\\n\\n\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":6,"text":"  \"user\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":7,"text":"    \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":8,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":9,"text":"  \"merged_at\": \"2026-07-29T20:59:24Z\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":10,"text":"  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"3c932624b8e3a4f0e4a9b140f2afe4ad8782141c\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":11,"text":"  \"base\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":12,"text":"    \"ref\": \"main\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4